graph TD
    A([🔑 Start: Log In to
Admin Control Panel]) --> B{MFA
Verified?}
    B -- No --> C[Display MFA Challenge]
    C --> A
    B -- Yes --> D[View Admin Dashboard:
System Health & Modules]
    D --> E{Select
Configuration Task}
    E -- Configure Academic Rules --> F[Open Rules Engine]
    F --> G[Set GPA Thresholds
Credit Limits, Probation Rules]
    G --> H[(ERP DB: Validate Rule
Conflicts & Save Policy Config)]
    H --> I{Conflicts
Detected?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Display Conflict Report
Adjust Parameters]
    J --> G
    I -- No --> K[Publish Rules as Active:
Apply to Current Term]
    K --> D
    E -- Manage Admission Pipeline --> L[Open Admission Config Panel]
    L --> M[Set Document Requirements
Deadlines, Capacity Limits]
    M --> N[(ERP DB: Update Admission
Cycle Configuration)]
    N --> D
    E -- Manage RBAC --> O[Open User & Roles Module]
    O --> P{RBAC
Action}
    P -- Create New Role --> Q[Define Role Name
Permissions & Scope]
    Q --> R[(ERP DB: Save Role
Definition)]
    P -- Assign Role to Staff --> S[Search Staff Member
by ID or Name]
    S --> T[Select Role to Assign
from Dropdown]
    T --> U[(ERP DB: Bind Role
to Staff Account)]
    U --> V[Send Access Confirmation
Email to Staff]
    P -- Revoke Access --> W[Search Staff Account]
    W --> X[(ERP DB: Deactivate
Permissions for Account)]
    R --> D
    V --> D
    X --> D
    D --> Y([✅ End: Admin Session Complete])